[{"text":"FCLoopFindSectors[{GLI[...], ...}] analyzes the indices of the GLI integrals in the given list and identifies sectors to which they belong. Notice that only GLIs with integer indices are supported.","anchor":"fcloopfindsectors"},{"text":"If the option GatherBy is set to True (default), the output will be a list of two lists, where the former contains the original integrals sorted w.r.t the identified sectors, while the latter is a list of all available sectors.","anchor":"fcloopfindsectors"},{"text":"For GatherBy->False, the output is a list containing all identified sectors without the original integrals.","anchor":"fcloopfindsectors"},{"text":"Setting the option Last to Truewill return only the top sector.","anchor":"fcloopfindsectors"},{"text":"Overview.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"ints = { GLI[topo1, {1, 1, 1, 1}], GLI[topo1, {2, 1, 2, 1}], GLI[topo2, {1, 0, 1, 1}], GLI[topo3, {1, 0, 1, -1}] };","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FCLoopFindSectors[ints]","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\left( \\begin{array}{ccc} \\left\\{\\{1,0,1,0\\},\\left\\{G^{\\text{topo3}}(1,0,1,-1)\\right\\}\\right\\} & \\left\\{\\{1,0,1,1\\},\\left\\{G^{\\text{topo2}}(1,0,1,1)\\right\\}\\right\\} & \\left\\{\\{1,1,1,1\\},\\left\\{G^{\\text{topo1}}(1,1,1,1),G^{\\text{topo1}}(2,1,2,1)\\right\\}\\right\\} \\\\ \\{1,0,1,0\\} & \\{1,0,1,1\\} & \\{1,1,1,1\\} \\\\ \\end{array} \\right)\\]","anchor":"cb2-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FCLoopFindSectors[ints, Last -> True]","anchor":"cb3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\left\\{\\{1,1,1,1\\},\\left\\{G^{\\text{topo1}}(1,1,1,1),G^{\\text{topo1}}(2,1,2,1)\\right\\}\\right\\}","anchor":"cb3-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FCLoopFindSectors[ints, GatherBy -> False]","anchor":"cb4","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\left( \\begin{array}{cccc} 1 & 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ \\end{array} \\right)\\]","anchor":"cb4-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FCLoopFindSectors[ints, GatherBy -> False, Last -> True]","anchor":"cb5","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\{1,1,1,1\\}\\]","anchor":"cb5-1","section":"Examples"}]